{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_005_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b35db0006d1d39df06f2fa3a6e28fe8aedfd08ccc21b735fae0b73246807a202", "ja": "（今日は、千鶴さんが受けたドラマの、\nオーディション結果が届く日だ！）", "zh": "（今天是千鹤小姐参加的电视剧试镜结果送达的日子！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_005_1001_038chz", "source_sha256": "7874f785f621f9eb8cea17afde187289b8b00dc86edbbfdfed34394527d1770b", "ja": "主人公の親友役としての演技……\n我ながら会心の出来でした。", "zh": "作为主角好友的演技……\n连我自己都觉得发挥得无可挑剔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_005_1002_038chz", "source_sha256": "9e7ed168280c2dcc1ba66a61a097290477586624098d2d42bc6f5268e65ed29c", "ja": "今日の連絡は、きっと合格に違いありませんわ！", "zh": "今天的通知肯定是合格的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_005_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a25817dd7b8ed41aebe34c5fec3704ee214f61d5ea110d7d0844b715ce06bd61", "ja": "そうですね。審査員の反応も良かったし、\n今回は大丈夫かと……あっ、連絡が来ました！", "zh": "是啊。评委的反应也很好，这次应该没问题……啊，来联系了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_005_1004_p", "source_sha256": "93ca58edaf524adad4a8bcffcb9b0c4659ddc8d436252512aa876f70bcce29a5", "ja": "もしもし……はい……はい……\nなるほど……わかりました……。", "zh": "喂……好的……好的……\n原来如此……明白了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_005_1005_038chz", "source_sha256": "4b382c0a0f767757db8900744cb7de967d9d341f96386104f0782b3fc9ab2e1a", "ja": "……{$P$}、\nいかがでしたか？", "zh": "……{$P$}，\n结果如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_005_1006_p", "source_sha256": "455f0e50f6b420293c7b563df2813f1a78c9cfde99607d129895d7108eaec706", "ja": "……親友役は、別の事務所の\n新人アイドルに決まったそうです……。", "zh": "……挚友那个角色，据说是定下了\n别家事务所的新人偶像……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_005_1007_p", "source_sha256": "98eae31b34b33a6d42fe531967d1e62558cbdf61b3a606c8a3810d271de3cb86", "ja": "千鶴さんの演技は、決して負けていなかったのに……\nすみません、俺の力不足です。", "zh": "明明千鹤小姐的演技一点也不逊色……  \n对不起，是我能力不足。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_005_1008_038chz", "source_sha256": "6be8dffaf53e8f64f4ee10a6b13d845905e80d833d2cdbd1d4bad2a392bdd7fc", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nもう、顔を上げてくださいまし！", "zh": "{$P$}……\n请您抬起头来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_005_1009_038chz", "source_sha256": "c90c31fac589f5df9faca43d3592697973f8b82806880de0ce5ba9638337ac11", "ja": "貴方が頑張ってくれていたことは、\nわたくしが誰よりも知っていますわ。", "zh": "您一直以来的努力，我比任何人都清楚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_005_1010_038chz", "source_sha256": "efb1300e4ddff2e42c3ecc1cc228e96d9cb3cc143eeb665f6a2113da286de52d", "ja": "卑下することなどありません。貴方もわたくしの\nプロデューサーなら、堂々としていてくださいまし！", "zh": "没有什么可自卑的。您既然是我的制作人，就请堂堂正正地面对一切吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_005_1011_p", "source_sha256": "895089e5e34262e438fbb14e76d85cb815b44338d4c1f7c29e573e206e370c7a", "ja": "千鶴さん……ありがとうございます。\n千鶴さんは強いですね。", "zh": "千鹤小姐……谢谢你。\n千鹤小姐真的很坚强呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_005_1012_038chz", "source_sha256": "c29184798d292d445ecda0c6870fbe24f6e271fef238600f0718ebf9ab341baf", "ja": "これしきのことで、挫けてなどいられませんわ！\nわたくしのアイドル人生は、始まったばかりですもの。", "zh": "这点小事，还不足以让我消沉！\n我的偶像人生才刚刚开始呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_005_1013_038chz", "source_sha256": "e363377c77fded35fd8ac45dc27f24b49b8c8c7188fcfc9f24fe09d78c768ead", "ja": "次のオーディションは、\n必ず合格してみせますわよ！　おーっほっほっほ！", "zh": "下次的试镜，我一定会合格给你看！哦——呵呵呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_005_1014_p", "source_sha256": "76780f25356edf2c669b3a8d675e718f58705880ca44fb6cf2b9044e42171d76", "ja": "（……それから数日後、ドラマのディレクターさんが、\nアポなしで突然、劇場へとやってきた）", "zh": "（……几天后，电视剧导演突然未经预约，来到了剧场。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_005_1015_director", "source_sha256": "085d086ce1986d02c5f5cade48cc64b957c6a80c8d2bcbbabab2059a0b292683", "ja": "突然お邪魔して申し訳ありません。実は、改めて\nご相談させていただきたいことがありまして。", "zh": "突然上门打扰，实在抱歉。其实，我有件事想再向您请教一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_005_1016_p", "source_sha256": "54c46822cf430be77768def031da9f9aa92977e0b7580344fef5e8d1f37bc613", "ja": "いえ！　それより、相談というのは……？", "zh": "哪里的话！比起这个，您说的商量是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_005_1017_038chz", "source_sha256": "4723a51cb2850577d650f8083f0525107d1952d828a4efee15a1b106e45370e0", "ja": "{$P$}、質問が……\nあら、お客様ですの？　失礼しました。", "zh": "{$P$}，我有个问题……\n啊，原来是客人吗？失礼了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_005_1018_038chz", "source_sha256": "079b895e232754aceb45d47ccd31b3dffbb3f8ab40f3bf844ae2d7bde4630950", "ja": "あら……？　貴方はたしか、\n先日ドラマのオーディションで……。", "zh": "哎呀……？您好像是\n前几天电视剧试镜时的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_005_1019_director", "source_sha256": "44fca67d1a1074f184aff12c87a8b643c498e18eb396f37cf0d1cb42ccce6b94", "ja": "私を、覚えていらっしゃるんですか？\nあの時、審査員は10人以上いたのに……。", "zh": "您还记得我吗？那时候评委明明有10人以上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_005_1020_038chz", "source_sha256": "6c9ea0a24f797b026ee107988b32653a5a99f52c480b9b9162bfa25220766836", "ja": "もちろんですわ！\n演技が華麗だと、褒めていただきましたから。", "zh": "当然记得了！\n因为您当时夸赞我的表演十分华丽呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_005_1021_038chz", "source_sha256": "b93c5ac96245da366145286b416291caa79881b8cac355495238de8c643dded7", "ja": "その言葉をいただいて、自信を持てましたもの。\n本当に、ありがとうございました。", "zh": "正是因为听到那句话，我才有了自信。\n真的，非常感谢您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_005_1022_director", "source_sha256": "455be122ce848744e7c604735b9ccb5fa57eb14633beafd5893b58c8d66cc068", "ja": "その一言しか話していないのに……\n人柄も素晴らしい……！", "zh": "明明只说了那一句话……  \n为人也很棒……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_005_1023_038chz", "source_sha256": "b4bdc7578dd7e53e66a60772340c964a443273d5316157a884002536638d87f6", "ja": "両親から、人のお顔とお名前は、\nきちんと覚えるようにと言われて育ちましたの。", "zh": "从小父母就教导我，要好好记住每个人的长相和名字。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_005_1024_038chz", "source_sha256": "a787ed64383c97d1c0828956a8f41526579dbfdfc777560dfb22c0b7cf2bf37d", "ja": "商店街にはいろんな……じゃなくて、\n我が家にはお客様が、たくさんいらっしゃるので！？", "zh": "商店街里有各种各样……不对，\n是因为我家经常有许多客人来拜访哦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_005_1025_director", "source_sha256": "6a24784640e4af1545e447f26ccc7a5cc3c17ee4757b91aea80b41630fcfee1c", "ja": "お嬢様育ちなんですね！　……うん！\nやっぱり二階堂さんにこそ、この役は相応しい！", "zh": "原来您是大小姐出身啊！……嗯！\n果然，这个角色只有二阶堂小姐才最合适！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_005_1026_director", "source_sha256": "1ccb7e9e21da5b01d08fd8c6ddab07aa8aa33cf5f59276ab75042bc6dc2a670c", "ja": "先日受けていただいたドラマ……クラスメイトの\nお嬢様役で、是非、出演してもらえないでしょうか！？", "zh": "前几天请您接下的那部电视剧……  \n能不能请您出演同班同学中的大小姐一角！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_005_1027_038chz", "source_sha256": "04f3f08a2d15c92b98f524583b01760f528cefa3a02821d4f256cba67b46357c", "ja": "えっ、お、お嬢様役！？\nわたくしが……。", "zh": "诶，千、千金大小姐的角色！？\n我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_005_1028_038chz", "source_sha256": "4c583adacf43d73377df65a61dc791f927052740b65b90647726d39fb1ccb7bd", "ja": "わたくしはもちろん、かまいませんけれども……\nあの、{$P$}。かまいませんこと？", "zh": "我这边当然是没有意见的……\n那个，{$P$}。您意下如何呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_005_1029_p", "source_sha256": "c85e94a199fb6829f83458c540f309376df8680d832ed3c5720613464278e886", "ja": "ええ、もちろんです！\nこちらこそ、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "嗯，当然没问题！\n我才要请您多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_005_1030_director", "source_sha256": "dbdbbff5837466d4cd19f174a086400fa03932c4df809a1909537bda52fe27b9", "ja": "よかった～。それじゃ、詳細は改めて連絡しますね。\nそれでは、今日はありがとうございました！", "zh": "太好了～。那么，详细情况之后再联系您。\n那么，今天谢谢您了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_005_1031_038chz", "source_sha256": "0691347edef959925251c42802e890fc6adbf8359fcad3ae252294af9ffeac36", "ja": "親友役を逃してしまったのは残念でしたけど、\n別の役とのご縁がありましたわね。", "zh": "虽然很遗憾没能得到闺蜜那个角色，\n但也与另一个角色结下了缘分呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_005_1032_038chz", "source_sha256": "3bbde21a869ed823c3dfb05b28d7d8ad7745e2104c691f854894dbedd2d123f9", "ja": "捨てる神あれば拾う神あり、\nといったところでしょうか。ふふっ。", "zh": "看来就是所谓“天无绝人之路”吧。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_005_1033_038chz", "source_sha256": "3680b0239d647b9927ec3fc28b1bde9a20dae02b0c91e81824b678c160960efb", "ja": "せっかく拾っていただいたのですから、\nしっかりと結果を残しますわよ！　おーっほっほっほ！", "zh": "既然难得被您捡了回来，我一定会好好拿出成果给您看！哦呵呵呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_005_1034_p", "source_sha256": "d1614dfcb36d1099acae79622f7c5eadc6c1e86572c227e25ea3628619afc938", "ja": "（その拾う神を引き寄せられたのも、\n千鶴さんの人柄によるところが大きい……）", "zh": "（能吸引来那位愿意伸出援手的贵人，很大程度上也是因为千鹤小姐的人品……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_005_1035_p", "source_sha256": "8e4d290be8295af30218dcbb0f8f0ac0719108ee0d425ee27db4c99a533c72f3", "ja": "（自然と人の気持ちを惹きつけてしまう千鶴さんは、\n身も心も本物のセレブなんだな）", "zh": "（会自然而然吸引他人心意的千鹤小姐，果然是身心皆为真正的名媛啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
